Comment: 0,0:23:15.65,0:23:19.86,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,550)\blur1\c&HD081FF&}大好き
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------EDCN-------------------
Comment: 0,0:21:45.59,0:21:54.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}能從你呼吸的律動感覺得到哦
Comment: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:56.68,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}真是溫暖啊
Comment: 0,0:21:56.68,0:22:06.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}珍惜的日常生活就在這裡
Comment: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:20.81,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}你知道嗎  你試圖藉由依偎傳達心意
Comment: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:26.52,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}你笨拙的那點  我很喜歡哦
Comment: 0,0:22:26.52,0:22:33.48,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}我現在一定很幸福
Comment: 0,0:22:34.05,0:22:41.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}在誰也無法知曉的命運牢籠中
Comment: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:43.70,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:48.10,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑著並稍微落淚
Comment: 0,0:22:48.10,0:22:51.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}我的存在意義
Comment: 0,0:22:51.84,0:22:58.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}將由你的雙手重新塑造
Comment: 0,0:23:00.52,0:23:04.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}你看  你看  對吧？
Comment: 0,0:23:08.57,0:23:12.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:23:12.12,0:23:15.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:23:15.65,0:23:19.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,550)\blur1\c&HD081FF&}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------SCREEN-------------------
